    <worksheet name='Sheet 1'>
      <layout-options>
        <title>
          <formatted-text>
            <run>Subescribes</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </title>
        <caption>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Between August 2021 and August 2026, Grameenphone grew from 83.18M to 87.20M subscribers (+4.8%), and Robi from 52.26M to 59.04M (+13.0%). GP dipped to about 79M in late 2022, after the June 2022 SIM-sales ban, then recovered. Robi’s growth was steadier and peaked near 59.5M in mid-2024 (from the chart).</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </caption>
      </layout-options>
      <table>
        <view>
          <datasources>
            <datasource caption='gp_vs_robi_telecom' name='federated.0flc0zn16g0ef31aue2cp02enhx4' />
