    <worksheet name='Sheet 3'>
      <layout-options>
        <title>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>GP lead over Robi</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </title>
        <caption>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>The gap between the two started at 30.9M and ended at 28.2M, a net narrowing of about 2.8M. It did not narrow steadily. It fell sharply from about 30.7M in May 2022 to about 24.9M by the end of 2022, bottomed near 23.5M in late 2023, recovered to about 29.2M in 2025, and dipped again to about 26.8M in December 2025 (all read from the chart). The axis doesn’t start at zero, so the swings look larger than they are relative to GP’s 87M base.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </caption>
      </layout-options>
      <table>
        <view>
          <datasources>
            <datasource caption='gp_vs_robi_telecom' name='federated.0flc0zn16g0ef31aue2cp02enhx4' />
          </datasources>
          <datasource-dependencies datasource='federated.0flc0zn16g0ef31aue2cp02enhx4'>
            <column caption='GP Subs' datatype='real' name='[Calculation_0816177646604288]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
              <calculation class='tableau' formula='SUM(IF [operator]=&quot;Grameenphone&quot; THEN [subscribers_m] END)' />
            </column>
            <column caption='Robi Subs' datatype='real' name='[Calculation_0816177646837761]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
              <calculation class='tableau' formula='SUM(IF [operator]=&quot;Robi Axiata&quot; THEN [subscribers_m] END)' />
